  "settings": {
    "logueTarget": {
      "module": "delfx"
    },
    "unitName": "Grain Mill"
  },
  "notes": "grain-mill, after the Axoloti patch: 8 looping grain voices from a 5.5 s buffer. TIME = clock rate (tempo division when MODE syncs), DEPTH = grain size (full travel freezes the buffer), MIX = dry/wet. Menu: MOT AMT/SPD/TYP (how far back grains come from, how fast, saw down/up/triangle/random), FEEDBK, WIDTH, ENV (grain envelope: short |\\ -> long /\\ -> short /|), CHANCE (random modes), MODE (free, sync, random, random sync). NTS-1 mkII; the voice is grain-voice.loguesub next to this file."
}
